arch/src/riscv64/boot.rs:96:    // riscv64 equivalent is sstatus.SUM, set per-process via the
kernel/src/lib.rs:411:    // supervisor mode unless sstatus.SUM=1. Since we haven't set SUM,
#  结论：全仓三处提到 SUM，无一处把它置起来。前两处是「本该怎么作」的意图
